{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7178a8ace3b34628c0fa390f04a0e266fbc65c268ba3f657365f6256a0675bcd","ja":"みんなで大掃除","zh":"大家一起大扫除","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ceca678e9840ad052f97620d330fb13c7d6db7bec322136def91626cc52f3268","ja":"一年の感謝を込めて、劇場を大掃除！\n私達の担当は給湯室よ。さあ、やるわよ～！","zh":"怀着对这一年的感谢，给剧场来次大扫除！\n我们负责的是茶水间哦。好了，动手吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8085fd6826f865bebd1a9ac0928a21b9b02b59d70859b5e05d18056006af8c4a","ja":"真美、テーブル拭くね！　すいすいすい～っと。\nはい終わり～♪　じゃ、そゆことで……。","zh":"真美来擦桌子啦！唰唰唰～地搞定。\n好啦擦完～♪那，就这么着……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"a1bf994c00f879e8e0d1d2099203e9873ce4d6c344ef1200fcff6779a4ca6ecd","ja":"さすが真美ちゃん、ピカピカなのです♪\nこの調子で、冷蔵庫の中もよろしくなのですよ！","zh":"真不愧是真美，擦得闪闪发亮呢♪\n照这个势头，冰箱里面也拜托你了哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"91cf704e64ea31b49e13672e4ac6eb52fd8b5712055a89a3be6451f94fdd9c02","ja":"ええ～っ！？　冷蔵庫なんて掃除してたら、\n真美もカチンコチンの氷漬けになっちゃうよ～っ！？","zh":"欸欸～！？　要是在那打扫冰箱的话，\n真美也会被冻得硬邦邦的啦～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3623665e9babdde1420742edb5e1af5c780728668b38419c5d260d18f3007117","ja":"ウフフ、カチンコチンにならないためにも、\n素早く終わらせないとね？　がんばりましょ♪","zh":"呵呵，为了不被冻得硬邦邦的，\n得赶快弄完才行呢？一起加油吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329","ja":"数分後……","zh":"过了几分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"3eeb7c12d50eb4749431acce2aba25c2d991bd3cacefadcea1eede545c99385b","ja":"（うう～、冷蔵庫の掃除、全然終わらないよ～……。\nもう飽きた～！）","zh":"（呜呜～，冰箱清理完全弄不完啦～……。\n我已经腻了～！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"973dff9f65d9382c30eac0bb5248eafa7ac51de6ae47f9674822a6d1f3937d75","ja":"あっ！　ねえねえ、まつり姫、このチラシ見てよ！\n世界のウミウシ展だって～！","zh":"啊！我说我说，茉莉公主，快看这张传单！\n据说是世界海蛞蝓展呢～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"51d81e8357f8d2bcc80a8033fe3adaaf16885f6a8443c2cc1f83fbf47ecc33c5","ja":"はいほー！　それはとっても気になるのです。\nお掃除が終わったら、じっくり見せてもらうのですよ♪","zh":"嗨吼——！那可真是太让人好奇了。\n等大扫除结束之后，我可要好好看一看哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d9f1111bee19331f247618365edb4a13f9d16148d70d24ee6ac71ce8eca331b6","ja":"え～……。\nあ、りおっち！","zh":"诶～……。\n啊，莉绪姐！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"4faec6bb1ac3e9bcccef6240c64bf729074db517e7a4f2c1b0a077e385da46a5","ja":"ねえ見て見て、真美のシラタマのような手が\nもうヒエヒエだよ～。カイロ買いにいこう～？","zh":"你看你看，真美像白玉一样的手\n已经冰凉冰凉的了～。去买个暖宝宝嘛～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"7e07d05f67c8af32a29233394d38281e8a44a205f8b1420fa8a2cde2761b80e7","ja":"シラタマじゃなくて、シラウオかしら？\nうーん、たしかに冷たくなってるかも？","zh":"不是白玉丸子，是银鱼吗？\n唔——确实好像变冷了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"6d6148f6dd61827fa1756c97aaa3b8732bcc857f603892fa84e75e2a4d4c9ec1","ja":"そうだよね！　それじゃあ……。","zh":"就是说嘛！　那么……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"862d576051ea66ba2d5761442172def1e6ec4d6523f2b41fdb0e9368b09bbc10","ja":"すりすりすり～！　はい、お姉さんが温めたから\nもう大丈夫よ♪　さ、続き続き。","zh":"蹭蹭蹭～！好啦，大姐姐给你暖过了，\n已经没问题了哦♪来，继续继续。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1511.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"e7e61d236d65a6a140ff5bd6a5949cfb1e25c30ebe4f80a961855d9b4035fc3a","ja":"そっか～……ってもう、ふたりとも\nリアクション悪すぎ～！　もっと反応してよ～！","zh":"这样啊～……真是的，你们两个\n反应也太冷淡了吧～！再多给点反应嘛～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
